{
  "name": "@ux-builder/design",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "license": "MIT OR Apache-2.0",
  "description": "The guided design loop (FEAT-018, CONTRACT-008): the ux-builder-design skill, the new artifact types' templates and prompts, the design state and the ux-builder-design command. CLI first, MCP optional; it makes no network request and calls no model.",
